<title>UKRAINE: TENNIS-UKRAINE BEAT NORWAY IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-UKRAINE BEAT NORWAY IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine took a winning 3-0 lead over Norway in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one play-off tie after victory in the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev/Dmitri Polyakov (Ukraine) beat Christian Ruud/ Helge Koll (Norway) 6-0 0-6 6-0 6-1</p>
